....This also ties into my belief that wishing for quest artifacts
should be "balanced" a little, but what if a cursed WoW *did* have
some chance of bringing a (ahem) slightly different item than the
item actually wished for?  Say, for example:

You wished for:		With a cursed WoW, you get:
----------------	--------------------------------
quest artifact		quest nemesis
dragon scale mail	a dragon
shield of reflection	Archon wearing it
Greyswandir		werewolf wielding it
Ogresmasher		ogre wielding it
Demonbane		demon  "      "
Fire/Frost Brand	elemental
Vorpal Blade		Jabberwocky
...etc.

One also might give uncursed wishes (from a WoW, lamp or potion) some
slight chance of the same, or make djinni appearing from cursed objects
have a chance of cruelly granting you one of *these* wishes....

Whaddya think?


